    "detailed_description": "Ultrawings is the first aerial-themed, open-world game where you'll pilot multiple aircraft to complete a variety of missions across an island-themed world.  <br><br>The game features full support for gamepad, HOTAS*, rudder pedals, and HTC Vive Wands, Oculus Touch, and Windows MR tracked motion controllers which allows you to use your hands to virtually interact with each aircraft's flight instruments for a truly unparalleled flight experience!  <br><br>The following HOTAS joysticks are officially supported:<br><br>Saitek X52<br>Saitek X55<br>Saitek X56<br>Thrustmaster HOTAS Warthog<br>Thrustmaster HOTASX<br>Thrustmaster HOTAS4<br>Thrustmaster T16000M<br><br>If you don't have one of the officially supported joysticks your stick will not work with the game. <br> <br>Due to the way we detect HMDs and joysticks the game does not support virtual desktop.  <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/639130/extras/ba917c8526e204ccbc9f5c0e2d90dd31.poster.avif?t=1625745550\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/639130/extras/ba917c8526e204ccbc9f5c0e2d90dd31.webm?t=1625745550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/639130/extras/ba917c8526e204ccbc9f5c0e2d90dd31.mp4?t=1625745550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><br>- Pilot 4 distinct aircraft using your virtual hands (or HOTAS and gamepad) for an unparalleled VR flight experience!  <br> <br>- Soar around 4 unique, beautifully stylized islands!   <br><br>- Earn money to buy new airports (which unlock new mission types) and new aircraft!  Ultrawings is a VR game with progression and gameplay!<br>  <br>- Lots of gameplay variety!  Pop balloons, snap photos, race, perform spot landings, fly through score rings, and more!  This is a flight game reminiscent of the ones you remember on your favorite console(s) from the big N.  <br><br>- The world feels alive!  Soar by flocks of seagulls, buzz other planes, and even fly by boats and cars! <br><br>- Full English voice-overs guide you through the game!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/639130/extras/de76cbd0011f80386274aaafceb22840.poster.avif?t=1625745550\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/639130/extras/de76cbd0011f80386274aaafceb22840.webm?t=1625745550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/639130/extras/de76cbd0011f80386274aaafceb22840.mp4?t=1625745550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>User Review Quotes:</strong><br><br>&quot;It's fun in a way no flight sim has been in a long time!&quot;<br><br>&quot;The flight model is a perfect combination of arcade and just enough realism to make it challenging.&quot;<br><br>&quot;Finally a sim that lets you hold the stick and operate the controls by hand.&quot;<br><br>&quot;It brings back memories of pilot wings 64.&quot;<br><br> Available for Arcades on SpringboardVR ",
    "about_the_game": "Ultrawings is the first aerial-themed, open-world game where you'll pilot multiple aircraft to complete a variety of missions across an island-themed world.  <br><br>The game features full support for gamepad, HOTAS*, rudder pedals, and HTC Vive Wands, Oculus Touch, and Windows MR tracked motion controllers which allows you to use your hands to virtually interact with each aircraft's flight instruments for a truly unparalleled flight experience!  <br><br>The following HOTAS joysticks are officially supported:<br><br>Saitek X52<br>Saitek X55<br>Saitek X56<br>Thrustmaster HOTAS Warthog<br>Thrustmaster HOTASX<br>Thrustmaster HOTAS4<br>Thrustmaster T16000M<br><br>If you don't have one of the officially supported joysticks your stick will not work with the game. <br> <br>Due to the way we detect HMDs and joysticks the game does not support virtual desktop.  <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/639130/extras/ba917c8526e204ccbc9f5c0e2d90dd31.poster.avif?t=1625745550\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/639130/extras/ba917c8526e204ccbc9f5c0e2d90dd31.webm?t=1625745550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/639130/extras/ba917c8526e204ccbc9f5c0e2d90dd31.mp4?t=1625745550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><br>- Pilot 4 distinct aircraft using your virtual hands (or HOTAS and gamepad) for an unparalleled VR flight experience!  <br> <br>- Soar around 4 unique, beautifully stylized islands!   <br><br>- Earn money to buy new airports (which unlock new mission types) and new aircraft!  Ultrawings is a VR game with progression and gameplay!<br>  <br>- Lots of gameplay variety!  Pop balloons, snap photos, race, perform spot landings, fly through score rings, and more!  This is a flight game reminiscent of the ones you remember on your favorite console(s) from the big N.  <br><br>- The world feels alive!  Soar by flocks of seagulls, buzz other planes, and even fly by boats and cars! <br><br>- Full English voice-overs guide you through the game!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/639130/extras/de76cbd0011f80386274aaafceb22840.poster.avif?t=1625745550\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/639130/extras/de76cbd0011f80386274aaafceb22840.webm?t=1625745550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/639130/extras/de76cbd0011f80386274aaafceb22840.mp4?t=1625745550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>User Review Quotes:</strong><br><br>&quot;It's fun in a way no flight sim has been in a long time!&quot;<br><br>&quot;The flight model is a perfect combination of arcade and just enough realism to make it challenging.&quot;<br><br>&quot;Finally a sim that lets you hold the stick and operate the controls by hand.&quot;<br><br>&quot;It brings back memories of pilot wings 64.&quot;<br><br> Available for Arcades on SpringboardVR ",
    "short_description": "Ultrawings is an aerial-themed, open-world flight game where you use your virtual hands to fly multiple aircraft to complete a variety of missions across a beautiful, island-themed world!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cWhile there are several VR games out there that allow you to fly, none have quite hit that perfect balance between arcade and simulation in the way that Ultrawings has.\u201d<br>90 \u2013 PS4 Experts<br><br>\u201cWords can hardly describe my love and enjoyment of this game.\u201d<br>100 \u2013 Game Chronicles<br>",
